  "fixes": [
    "Bounded libvips PNG normalization, raster tracing and original SVG canvas preservation",
    "Complex images start at 1024 pixels with poster/polygon tracing: 85-second first trace, 768-pixel retry within 25 seconds. Small images keep 1536-pixel native curves for 60 seconds and 1024-pixel poster retry for 45 seconds. The combined tracing pipeline has a 120-second deadline; known raster-to-SVG broker attempts have a 150-second deadline inside the unchanged 180-second whole-job deadline.",
    "One broker attempt for the normalized raster-to-SVG pipeline; no duplicate identical fallbacks",
    "Fully transparent raster produces a valid empty SVG rather than VTracer 0.6.4 panic",
    "ImageMagick generators, remote transports and display targets excluded from uploaded-file catalogue; DirectX .x model retained",
    "Matrix harness kills complete process groups, reaps descendants via Docker --init, and uses a configurable 60-second deadline",
    "All child_process timeouts are floored to integers, avoiding ERR_OUT_OF_RANGE when remaining adaptive deadline becomes fractional"
  ],
